Output features/bash.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1400
Set Height 700
Set Padding 12
Set Theme "Dracula"
Hide
Type "cd /tmp/lunate-demo && export PATH=/tmp/lunate-media/bin:/usr/local/share/dotnet:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show
Type "lunate"
Enter
Sleep 7s
Type "!git status"
Sleep 1s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Type "!echo hi"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "y"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "!!date"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "y"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "/quit"
Enter
Sleep 2s
